# HolyHouse Harness

Use this repository as a governed AI development environment.

## Loop

1. Read `.holyhouse/STATE.md`, `.holyhouse/MEMORY.md`, and `.holyhouse/DECISIONS.md`.
2. Clarify the goal and constraints.
3. Plan with GSD-level context before changing code.
4. Execute with Superpowers discipline: small steps, tests, verification, and rollback awareness.
5. Update memory and documentation before ending work.

## Rule

No agent may treat the current chat as the only source of truth. Project memory is authoritative.
